    "diagnosis": "Spitz melanocytoma (atypical Spitz tumour)",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Nests of large monomorphic epithelioid cells with enlarged rounded nuclei, relatively prominent nucleoli, abundant cytoplasm, occasional mitotic figures, and an inflammatory cell reaction. This tumour harboured a <em>MAP3K8</em> fusion and a homozygous deletion of <em>CDKN2A</em>. No <em>TERT</em> promoter mutation was detected.",
    "source": "Armita Bahrami",
    "copyright": "",
